d-insights-to-version-3-0.md","line":33},{"title":"Gain insights from your billing data with the FOCUS standard for Microsoft Azure billing","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/schedule-azure-billing-job.md","line":37},{"title":"View cloud cost data in your preferred currency for multiple cloud service providers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/operation-view-ccm-ws.md","line":44},{"title":"Get support for your Azure MPA model when operating under an MSP","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/azure-pricesht-sched-dwnld-cloudin.md","line":48},{"title":"Multi-currency setup on the Operations view","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/operation-view-ccm-ws.md","line":55},{"title":"Currency preference option on the Operations view","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/operation-view-ccm-ws.md","line":59},{"title":"Granular instance operator role","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/cloud-insights-roles.md","line":66},{"title":"ServiceNow Store","target":"https://store.servicenow.com/sn_appstore_store.do#!/store/home","line":73},{"title":"ServiceNow Store version history release notes","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/bundle/store-release-notes/page/release-notes/store/sn-store-release-notes.html","line":73},{"title":"IT Asset Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/it-asset-management.md","line":77},{"title":"Software Asset Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/c_Softwar